<title>PORTUGAL: Trade on Lisbon bourse interrupted.</title>
<headline>Trade on Lisbon bourse interrupted.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on the Lisbon bourse Continuous Market has been interrupted due to technical problems, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said they did not know when trade would resume.  </p>
<p>The interruption lasted about 10 minutes and trade resumed at 0956 GMT, the official added.</p>
